

when building lsqsh_evb, the default config file used is boards/lsqsh_evb_cpu1.conf.

Only in the lsqsh_evb, the otbn module can be used to execute the ecdsa or sm2 algorithms. Otherwise, the default software ecdsa and sm2 must be used.

If you want to use the SHA function of the hardware, set CONFIG_ENABLE_LS_OTBN_HASH=n
If you want to use the SHA function of the otbn moudle, set CONFIG_ENABLE_LS_OTBN_HASH=y